# The side-panel bundle and its stylesheet are build output from
# extension/src, committed so the store package can be built and audited
# from a checkout alone. Marking them generated keeps a 776 KB minified diff out
# of review and out of the repository's language statistics; the CI bundle check
# is what proves they match the sources.
extension/sidepanel/panel.js linguist-generated=true -diff
extension/sidepanel/panel.css linguist-generated=true -diff
